BeI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Il bozzolo della volubilità II","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11009","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21006","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"29095","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61422","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281949","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"2002","synopsis":"Asako's poor health begins to interfere with her work. Yuuji senses her change in condition, and as he covers for her, he starts to think he may have found his life's meaning. Asako tries to respect Yuuji's resolve, but JB, who watches over both of them closely, is apprehensive about Yuuji's attempts to return to that violent world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m60JFaExHq4Uti2TiMpShWo7dh4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il bozzolo della volubilità II","synopsis":"Asako's poor health begins to interfere with her work. Yuuji senses her change in condition, and as he covers for her, he starts to think he may have found his life's meaning. Asako tries to respect Yuuji's resolve, but JB, who watches over both of them closely, is apprehensive about Yuuji's attempts to return to that violent world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m60JFaExHq4Uti2TiMpShWo7dh4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Il bozzolo della volubilità III","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11009","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21006","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"29095","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61422","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281949","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers