orse than they thought. Although they have lost Yuuji and have been driven from the academy, they secure a new base of operations and plan a rescue mission for him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOyHUwQU6E0tU2a03UCOyTA8nxy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"I semi del Blanc Aile II","synopsis":"After Yumiko gets in touch with the informant \"Jimmy,\" she and the other girls at Mihama Academy learn that the current situation is even worse than they thought. Although they have lost Yuuji and have been driven from the academy, they secure a new base of operations and plan a rescue mission for him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOyHUwQU6E0tU2a03UCOyTA8nxy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"I semi del Blanc Aile III","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11009","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21006","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"29095","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61422","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281949","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"2007","synopsis":"A formless supporter, \"Thanatos,\" suddenly supports Amane and the others. \"Her\" objective is also to liberate and rescue Yuuji Kazami. Thanatos and the Mihama girls' interests align and begin preparing to execute their mission. The girls are perplexed by Thanatos's seemingly cryptic instructions that unfold via cell phone, but they bring the girls better results than they ever expected in bringing their goal to fruition.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d54NGiwjZiQ8woxIMhtXnx23mg0.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"I semi del Blanc Aile III","synopsis":"A formless supporter, \"Thanatos,\" suddenly supports Amane and the others. \"Her\" objective is also to liberate and rescue Yuuji Kazami. Thanatos and the Miham